  "changes": [
    "Stage native arm64e objects through the existing parser, relocation and supported native unwind owners, with exact CPU subtype matching.",
    "Share authenticated object-word decoding with analysis and retain all keys, signed addends, final local targets and exact external providers.",
    "Admit explicitly declared dylibs in the same transaction as native signing recipes; reject unused/invalid declarations before publication.",
    "Install page-isolated SG_READ_ONLY storage for explicit constant segments and default __DATA,__const, retaining ordinary mutable pages.",
    "Share load-command payload ownership between header and compact-unwind placement; recognize inline LC_ID_DYLIB and reuse checked TEXT tails without moving code/data VAs.",
    "Reject malformed native relocations, mismatched ABI capability bits, occupied metadata capacity and post-install removal of RELRO protection."
  ],
